     "y": 0.05,
     "width": 0.76,
     "height": 0.15
    }
   ],
   "line": "Remember me when I am gone away, / Gone far away into the silent land; / When you can no more hold me by the hand, / Nor I half turn to go yet turning stay.",
   "startMs": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "future-you-planned",
   "image": "/poetry/remember/scenes/02-future-you-planned.webp",
   "lines": 4,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.65,
    "y": 0.35
   },
   "textPreset": "searchlight-scan",
   "transitionMs": 1150,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.06,
     "y": 0.05,
     "width": 0.76,
     "height": 0.14
    }
   ],
   "line": "Remember me when no more day by day / You tell me of our future that you planned: / Only remember me; you understand / It will be late to counsel then or pray.",
   "startMs": 12800
  },
  {
   "id": "afterwards-remember",
   "image": "/poetry/remember/scenes/03-afterwards-remember.webp",
   "lines": 4,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.55,
    "y": 0.58
   },
   "textPreset": "echo-fade",
   "transitionMs": 1270,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.06,
     "y": 0.05,
     "width": 0.76,
     "height": 0.15
    }
   ],
   "line": "Yet if you should forget me for a while / And afterwards remember, do not grieve: / For if the darkness and corruption leave / A vestige of the thoughts that once I had,",
   "startMs": 24960
  },
  {
   "id": "forget-and-smile",
   "image": "/poetry/remember/scenes/04-forget-and-smile.webp",
   "lines": 2,
   "focalPoint": {
    "x": 0.65,
    "y": 0.3
   },
   "textPreset": "farewell-drift",
   "transitionMs": 1500,
   "safeZones": [
    {
     "x": 0.06,
     "y": 0.05,
     "width": 0.76,
     "height": 0.13
    }
   ],
   "line": "Better by far you should forget and smile / Than that you should remember and be sad.",
   "startMs": 36160
  }
 ],
